image/asset/2150/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_LegalZoom.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2150/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_LegalZoom.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2150/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_LegalZoom.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2150/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_LegalZoom.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2150/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_LegalZoom.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2150/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_LegalZoom.jpg","In 1999, LegalZoom founders and former lawyers Brian Liu and Brian Lee set out to democratize law by making fundamental legal resources available to everyone on the Internet. Beginning with basic forms and documents, the early-aughts start-up quickly moved toward regulatory compliance, company formation, wills, and estate planning. \r\n\r\nMore than two decades later, LegalZoom has established the brand recognition and a superior customer experience that can only be built by patience and persistence. LegalZoom is the market leader, offering automation for legal tasks and compliance as well as referrals to pre-screened attorneys for customized legal advice. With over $400 million in revenue, consistent profitability and strong margins, LegalZoom has a bright future as a successful public company.","Discover how our partner LegalZoom is democratizing the law by making fundamental legal resources, information, forms, and documents available to all.","LegalZoom - IVP Portfolio Companies - Legal Tech VC","LegalZoom - IVP Portfolio","A leading provider of legal documents helping people launch and live their dreams",{"id":32,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"371","2011-01-01","https://careers.ivp.com/companydetail.php?cid=1441&v=38","Daniel Wernikoff","/content/le